 of the  \nCommittee. The Assistant to the President for Economic and Domestic Policy  \nshall serve as the Secretary of the Committee.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 1","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The Committee shall advise the President with respect to  \nthe objectives and conduct of the overall education policy of the United  \nStates.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) In the performance of its advisory duties the Committee shall conduct a  \ncontinuing review and assessment of education policy and shall report there­\non to the President whenever requested.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The heads of executive agencies shall, to the extent  \npermitted by law, provide the Committee such information with respect to  \neducation policy matters as the Committee requires for the purpose of carrying  \nout its functions.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 3(a)","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec3(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Members of the Committee shall serve without any compensation for their  \nwork on the Committee. However, they shall be entitled to travel expenses,  \nincluding per diem in lieu of subsistence, as authorized by law for persons  \nserving intermittently in the Government service (5 U.S.C. 5701-5707).","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 3(b)","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec3(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Any expenses of the Committee shall be paid from funds available for the  \nexpenses of the Office of Policy Development.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 3(c)","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec3(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. G e n e r a l. Notwithstanding any other Executive order, the responsibil­\nities of the President under the Federal Advisory Committee Act, as amended,  \nshall be performed by the Assistant to the President for Economic and  \nDomestic Policy or his designee, except that the Administrator of General  \nServices shall, on a reimbursable basis, provide such administrative services  \nas may be required.\n(b) The Committee shall terminate on December 31, 1990, unless sooner  \nextended.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19; Sec. 4","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12687#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"54 FR 34127, PDF pages 19-19","sha256":"c27a8535294296f11ababb5b93b827ba18b0fe17cd64aea24296febe1218439e","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1989-08-18/pdf/FR-1989-08-18.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 7 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:12687"}
